    "lawCode": "Amd §240, V & T L",
    "lawSection": "Vehicle and Traffic Law",
    "memo": " BILL NUMBER:  S1741\n\n TITLE OF BILL :\nAn act to amend the vehicle and traffic law, in relation to requiring\nevening court hours for parking violations\n\n\n PURPOSE OR GENERAL IDEA OF BILL :\nTo require evening court hours for parking violations.\n\n SUMMARY OF SPECIFIC PROVISIONS :\nAmends subdivision 2 of section 240 of the vehicle and traffic law\nadding a new paragraph h to provide for evening court hours for\nparking violations.\n\n JUSTIFICATION :\nFines for parking violations have been increasing. This bill seeks to\nallow working people to contest parking tickets without having to take\ntime off from work.\n\n PRIOR LEGISLATIVE HISTORY :\nThis legislation was previously introduced.\n\n FISCAL IMPLICATIONS :\nTo be determined.\n\n EFFECTIVE DATE :\nThis act shall take effect on the ninetieth day after it shall have\nbecome a law.\n",
